retrievePrincipal
├── caller lacks YIELDMANAGER_ROLE → revert
├── request is zero or no principal exists → revert
├── partial request cannot quote valid shares → revert
├── partial request with healthy backing → redeem previewWithdraw shares and reduce book value exactly
├── partial request after a loss → redeem pro-rata shares so early callers cannot export the loss
├── request is at least all principal → preserve unclaimed yield shares when the strategy is profitable
├── request is at least all principal after a loss → redeem remaining shares and zero principal accounting
├── Yearn liquidity or exit protection fails → revert atomically
└── paused/emergency mode → retrieval remains available with configured emergency maxLoss
